that was created in perfection.

825
00:49:05,009 --> 00:49:06,477
- Mm-hm.
- Huh?

826
00:49:06,477 --> 00:49:08,979
They’ll be no place
for the weak.

827
00:49:08,979 --> 00:49:11,582
The ugly.

828
00:49:11,582 --> 00:49:13,818
Vermin like you.

829
00:49:13,818 --> 00:49:15,052
Go to hell!

830
00:49:15,052 --> 00:49:17,955
Or at least edmonton!

831
00:49:17,955 --> 00:49:20,291
Our day of conquest
is oncoming.

832
00:49:20,291 --> 00:49:23,594
I’m sorry, what did you say
