862
00:51:04,128 --> 00:51:06,730
Ah, i’ve escaped-- aah!

863
00:51:09,733 --> 00:51:11,802
Cripes, he rolled
out of bounds.

864
00:51:16,941 --> 00:51:18,876
What is this obsession
with not showing us

865
