866
00:51:20,244 --> 00:51:21,779
I don’t know.

867
00:51:26,417 --> 00:51:27,885
He’s got a funny tan line.

868
00:51:27,885 --> 00:51:29,453
Yeah.

869
00:51:34,725 --> 00:51:39,296
