907
00:54:14,651 --> 00:54:18,755
Must slip back
and sell candy bars for band.

908
00:54:24,428 --> 00:54:27,731
Uh, i’m just a bush.
You may want to pan off me.

909
00:54:31,034 --> 00:54:35,072
What the-- hey,
I had a bead on a good eh.

910
00:54:35,072 --> 00:54:38,342
Eh, eh, eh...

911
00:54:42,846 --> 00:54:45,749
