Yeah, my hair’s a mess.
So what?

934
00:56:19,142 --> 00:56:20,777
You were one of them?

935
00:56:20,777 --> 00:56:24,047
An uncooked
bratwurst with hair.

936
00:56:24,047 --> 00:56:25,349
[Panting]

937
00:56:25,349 --> 00:56:26,516
I was.

938
00:56:26,516 --> 00:56:29,219
