941
00:56:33,190 --> 00:56:35,726
Let me die first,
then i’ll tell you.

942
00:56:37,294 --> 00:56:39,429
It started
with the nightmares.

943
00:56:39,429 --> 00:56:41,298
[Rhythmic humming]

944
