954
00:57:10,360 --> 00:57:11,495
I don’t know.

955
00:57:11,495 --> 00:57:15,399
Ugh, now it’s
turned into a stroke!

956
00:57:15,399 --> 00:57:18,502
Satoris found out
I was only a half-blood.

957
