980
00:58:51,395 --> 00:58:55,232
Winnipeg confidential.

981
00:58:55,232 --> 00:58:57,567
I should tell you that I wheeze
loudly when i’m scared.

982
00:58:57,567 --> 00:59:01,071
[Wheezing]

983
00:59:01,071 --> 00:59:05,575
Uh, guillaume, this is my place.
